The '''Pest Wrangler?''' is an [[NPC]] that only appears in {{zone|The Garden}}. This NPC will only appear under {{NPCSprite|Finnegan}}'s Blooming Business Perk. They always ask for {{Item|Tasty Cheese}}. Completing their offer will reward the player with a total of {{Item|Fine Flour|amount=55}}.

